  "episode_summary": "James Staples and Luke Heslop visit Saravana Bhavan in Southall with Gautam (Mukesh), an international student from Tamil Nadu. They discuss traditional South Indian food, heirloom grains, migration for education, working in the UK, and how Saravana Bhavan has become a global symbol of Indian vegetarian cuisine. The episode also includes insights from Dr. Devanshi Chanchani about the restaurant's cultural significance within India and across the global Indian diaspora.",
